{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41345","headline":"和韩昭从驾过白卫岭 · 王仁裕","name":"和韩昭从驾过白卫岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙斾飘颻指极边，到时犹更二三千。\n登高晓蹋巉岩石，冒冷朝冲断续烟。\n自学汉皇开土宇，不同周穆好神仙。\n秦民莫遣无恩及，大散关东别有天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}